#: ../../source/about/faq.md:1 69c65c0791a84d85b1d5683f41b93fd6
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:3 03b0f675ea6740aa885742e294dff4ea
msgid "安装与环境"
msgstr "Installation & environment"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:5 f87399c33ee04b1ba335ad7d847d386c
msgid "为什么推荐 pixi 而不是 conda？"
msgstr "Why recommend pixi over conda?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:7 142e8e3da7fd489d9e96f4886b2751a7
msgid ""
"pixi 提供精确的依赖版本锁定（``pixi.lock``），确保在不同设备上安装的包版本完全一致，这对模型数值可复现性至关重要。此外，pixi"
" 预置了多套环境（PyTorch / Mamba / DHG），无需手动配置。"
msgstr ""
"pixi provides precise dependency version locking (``pixi.lock``) so that the "
"installed package versions are identical across machines, which is critical "
"for numerical reproducibility of models. In addition, pixi ships several "
"preconfigured environments (PyTorch / Mamba / DHG) with no manual setup "
"required."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:11 8bd4554e8ea44c9f9fc20ca389f0a031
msgid "支持 Windows / macOS 吗？"
msgstr "Does it support Windows / macOS?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:13 43e1e5190e844605acb9b0414a630007
msgid "目前不支持。框架依赖的部分包（如某些 PyG 扩展）仅提供 Linux 预编译版本。"
msgstr ""
"Not currently. Some packages the framework depends on (e.g. certain PyG "
"extensions) only ship prebuilt Linux wheels."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:17 5350a587b22c463b91e43f9a759b9d26
msgid "Ubuntu 22.04 无法运行怎么办？"
msgstr "What if it cannot run on Ubuntu 22.04?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:19 ffdf6dae64394c57a1105fe67aaf97f5
msgid "框架依赖较新的 glibc，Ubuntu 22.04 的 glibc 版本不满足要求。请使用 Ubuntu 24.04 或更新的系统。"
msgstr ""
"The framework depends on a newer glibc than the version shipped with Ubuntu "
"22.04. Please use Ubuntu 24.04 or newer."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:21 c74e668e62c04b04a532bb1620d4ed88
msgid "安装后 CUDA 不可用？"
msgstr "CUDA unavailable after installation?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:23 f7dc0b00665e495081d7a3cc71875f5a
msgid "检查 PyTorch 是否正确识别 GPU："
msgstr "Check whether PyTorch detects the GPU correctly:"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:29 800a2d4763e04f7486f5a0bc989f9509
msgid ""
"如果返回 ``False``，请确认安装的是 CUDA 版本的 PyTorch（非 CPU 版），且 CUDA 驱动版本与 PyTorch 要求的"
" CUDA 版本兼容。"
msgstr ""
"If it returns ``False``, verify that you installed the CUDA build of PyTorch "
"(not the CPU build) and that your CUDA driver version is compatible with the "
"CUDA version required by PyTorch."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:31 d1443b67b40d4162a0f9fbbd701c1cdb
msgid "数据处理"
msgstr "Data processing"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:33 de446a0292c04014b1f321f3cea89ee9
msgid "下载数据集失败？"
msgstr "Dataset download failed?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:35 dcb8d4be89e948cc8c8092989e3339e9
msgid "部分数据集源可能在网络受限环境下无法访问。可以尝试："
msgstr ""
"Some dataset sources may be unreachable in restricted-network environments. "
"You can try:"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:45 802a19a523b24229a4159291de95dcdc
msgid "处理 EdNet-KT1 时内存不足？"
msgstr "Out of memory when processing EdNet-KT1?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:47 ee3c324d384348aab9516df368aba973
msgid "EdNet-KT1 包含超过 1.3 亿条交互记录，处理时可能需要较大内存。建议："
msgstr ""
"EdNet-KT1 contains over 130 million interaction records and may require "
"substantial memory to process. Recommendations:"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:49 cbbe6bebf690426dbb41da32451b2ba6
msgid "使用 ``--sample_ratio`` 参数先采样"
msgstr "Sample first using the ``--sample_ratio`` argument"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:50 bba6f052f6034ea380e14b8ed6d9b31f
msgid "确保机器有至少 32GB 内存"
msgstr "Ensure the machine has at least 32GB of memory"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:52 e3e9f40af82f4e25b30b3b1d41fa2a00
msgid "训练"
msgstr "Training"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:54 1851302755034e73b537378cf60c7e19
msgid "训练速度很慢？"
msgstr "Training is slow?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:56 12fcd322723148baa1c4a8ea34af34ed
msgid "确认使用的是 GPU 环境（``pixi shell``，非 ``pixi shell -e cpu``）"
msgstr ""
"Confirm you are using the GPU environment (``pixi shell``, not ``pixi shell "
"-e cpu``)"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:57 8369d441370e4641b33ec6a16cf64b47
msgid "减小 batch_size 可能导致训练变慢，尝试增大到 GPU 显存允许的最大值"
msgstr ""
"A smaller batch_size can slow down training; try increasing it to the "
"maximum the GPU memory allows"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:58 161065a9832043d7807a518222e56554
msgid "部分模型（如 DyGKT）支持 ``--max_grad_norm`` 参数优化训练稳定性"
msgstr ""
"Some models (e.g. DyGKT) support the ``--max_grad_norm`` argument to improve "
"training stability"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:60 b87a5008618a4f78a1c69ecdcc2675bf
msgid "如何选择合适的模型？"
msgstr "How do I choose the right model?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:62 fc13f74339d04f2aa8e0c41ce7227e4a
msgid ""
"不同模型在不同数据集和任务粒度（KC 级 / 问题级）上表现不同。请参考 [Model Zoo](../model-zoo.md) "
"排行榜查看各模型在标准 benchmark 上的性能。"
msgstr ""
"Different models perform differently across datasets and task granularities "
"(KC-level / question-level). See the [Model Zoo](../model-zoo.md) "
"leaderboard for each model's performance on standard benchmarks."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:64 cc339d3949b94d6fbc0a689b7237d890
msgid "训练中断后如何恢复？"
msgstr "How do I resume after a training interruption?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:66 ae85e52f497942bd877764e2dc90bad9
msgid ""
"训练默认会在每个 epoch 后保存检查点。如果中断，可以检查 ``runs/`` "
"目录下的最新运行。目前框架不直接支持断点续训，需要手动从检查点恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Training saves a checkpoint after every epoch by default. If interrupted, "
"check the latest run under the ``runs/`` directory. The framework does not "
"currently support automatic resume; you need to restore from the checkpoint "
"manually."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:68 dbed9d526d914a7abfa879da81bb4da6
msgid "模型开发"
msgstr "Model development"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:70 6a50bb7b06b9481d81e63c72935332f7
msgid "如何添加新模型？"
msgstr "How do I add a new model?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:72 84d035046cbf45b99e43d126eb74b825
msgid ""
"请参阅 [添加新模型](../user-guide/new-model.md) 指南。核心步骤：创建模型目录 → 实现 trainer → "
"注册装饰器。无需修改框架核心代码。"
msgstr ""
"See the [Adding a new model](../user-guide/new-model.md) guide. The core "
"steps are: create the model directory, implement the trainer, then register "
"with a decorator. No modification of framework core code is required."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:74 4cd489baa04f4d4f99908ca0d7dd4f50
msgid "为什么我的模型没有被自动发现？"
msgstr "Why is my model not discovered automatically?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:76 1b5dc8adacd347b4b2b25949b7f2ede9
msgid ""
"确保 trainer 文件中使用了 ``@register_trainer(\"ModelName\")`` 装饰器。框架通过静态 AST 扫描 "
"``model/`` 目录下的 ``.py`` 文件来发现注册。"
msgstr ""
"Make sure the trainer file uses the ``@register_trainer(\"ModelName\")`` "
"decorator. The framework discovers registrations by statically AST-scanning "
"the ``.py`` files under the ``model/`` directory."

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:80 b9d19f583f8d4d4fa410f485056fc5af
msgid "多环境兼容（GPU / Mamba / DHG）如何处理？"
msgstr "How is multi-environment compatibility (GPU / Mamba / DHG) handled?"

#: ../../source/about/faq.md:82 1caed2437f7948a0b7fd82c99c354443
msgid ""
"底层采用懒加载——只有当你实际调用 ``TRAINERS.get(\"ModelName\")`` "
"时才会导入对应模块。这意味着你的模型文件可以导入仅在特定环境可用的包（如 ``mamba-ssm``），只要用户只在正确的环境下调用就不会报错。"
msgstr ""
"The underlying mechanism uses lazy loading — the corresponding module is "
"imported only when you actually call ``TRAINERS.get(\"ModelName\")``. This "
"means your model files can import packages that are only available in a "
"specific environment (e.g. ``mamba-ssm``), and as long as the user invokes "
"it under the correct environment, no error will occur."
